  "details": "I'm an artist (not a 3d artist) and today I watched a video of a musician playing an instrument in Vrchat and thought how could I show my art or do a live demo in Vrchat. I starting brainstorming about how to achieve my dilemma and screen share popped into my head. I'm not sure how you could implement it, but an Idea  I have is that the player could create a popup window that has the ability to show your desktop/program and is visible to other players though it could be toggled through safety settings.",
